classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ initial design (draft). Keep this file updated so it matches the final implementation.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +list~str~ preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(description: str) bool
        +complete_task(description: str, on: date) Task
    }

    class Task {
        +str description
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str time
        +str frequency
        +str pet_name
        +bool completed
        +date due_date
        +priority_value() int
        +reschedule(time: str) None
        +start_minutes() int
        +mark_complete(on: date) Task
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +list~Task~ plan
        +list~Task~ skipped
        +list~str~ conflicts
        +sort_by_priority(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +sort_by_time(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name: str, completed: bool) list~Task~
        +mark_task_complete(task: Task, on: date) Task
        +find_conflicts(tasks: list~Task~) list~tuple~
        +detect_conflicts(tasks: list~Task~) list~str~
        +generate_plan(on: date) list~Task~
        +explain_plan() str
    }

    Owner "1" --> "0..*" Pet : has
    Pet "1" --> "0..*" Task : needs
    Scheduler "1" --> "1" Owner : plans for
    Scheduler ..> Task : schedules
